{"id":"usualmente","lemma":"usualmente","pos":"adv","rank":3467,"glosses":["usually"],"ipa":"/uˌswalˈmente/","examples":[{"text":"¿Cuántos días usualmente toma llegar allá?","en":"How many days does it usually take to get there?","words":[{"g":"how much","l":"cuánto"},{"g":"day","l":"día"},null,{"g":"conquest"},{"g":"to arrive, get"},{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"¿Cuánto consigue usted dormir usualmente?","en":"How much sleep do you usually get?","words":[{"g":"how much"},{"g":"to achieve","l":"conseguir"},{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"to sleep"},null]},{"text":"Usualmente me baño antes del desayuno.","en":"I usually take a shower before breakfast.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594935","words":[null,{"g":"me"},{"g":"bath"},{"g":"earlier"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"breakfast"}]},{"text":"Yo usualmente leo mientras como.","en":"I usually read while I eat.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518192","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"Leo"},{"g":"while, whilst, as"},{"g":"as"}]},{"text":"Usualmente murmuro mientras trabajo.","en":"I often hum while I work.","words":[null,null,{"g":"while, whilst, as"},{"g":"work, job"}]}]}